<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυχν-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rose campion, Lychnis coronaria</i>, used for garlands,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				4.1.23
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.100
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀγρία</span>
			<i>corn cockle, Agrostemma Githago</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				101
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				899
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίρρινον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a precious
			stone <i>that emits light</i>, prob. <i>ruby</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Syr.D.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dercyl.
				11
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνις</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				329
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				271
			</span></i>.</div>
